@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
title Illustrative timing — claim expiry is not remote no-effect
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

concise "Coordinator knowledge" as K
concise "Claim ownership" as C
concise "External observation" as E
scale 1 as 170 pixels
@0
K is Pending
C is Unclaimed
E is None
@1
K is DispatchPossible
C is Generation1
E is NoReply
@2
K is UnknownEffect
C is Expired
E is Unresolved
@3
K is Reconciling
C is Generation2
E is Unresolved
@4
K is RecordedOutcome
C is Generation2
E is ObservedAccepted
@5
K is RecordedOutcome
C is Released
E is ObservedAccepted
legend bottom
 Ticks 0–5 are illustrative ordered positions, not seconds, measured duration or chosen lease/timeout values.
 This example eventually observes acceptance; other runs can remain unknown or reveal partial/no-effect results.
 Local Generation2 does not terminate Generation1's possible remote action.
endlegend
@enduml
